dialogue_lines = Array[String](["Come in, son. Doors stay open - not much left in here worth locking up.", "Folks bring me stranger tales every month. Lights out on the flats, cattle gone quiet.", "I say a word over each of them and hope that is enough. It generally is not.", "Sit a while if you need to. The Lord keeps longer hours than the bank does."])

